          "original_text": "      business_logic: '- Build base from intermediate.int_hubspot__deals_enhanced: - Select deal, pipeline, owner, and timestamp fields; rename amount to deal_amount and closed_date to close_date. - deal_cycle_time_days: number of whole days from created_date to close_date when both exist; otherwise NULL. - deal_status: - Won: closed_date present and amount > 0 - Lost: closed_date present and amount = 0 - Open: closed_date absent - Unknown: any other case (e.g., closed with negative or NULL amount) - deal_size_category: - Enterprise (100K+): amount >= 100000 - Large (50K-100K): 50000–<100000 - Medium (10K-50K): 10000–<50000 - Small (<10K): >0–<10000 - No Value: amount <= 0 or NULL - created_year/created_quarter are extracted from created_date; closed_year/closed_quarter are extracted only when close_date exists. - Compute pipeline_stage_analysis grouped by (deal_pipeline, deal_pipeline_stage), excluding NULL stage IDs: - deals_in_stage: number of deals in the group. - won_from_stage / lost_from_stage: counts where status is Won / Lost. - stage_win_rate: percentage of group deals that are Won (0–100); 0 when the denominator would be zero. - total_stage_value: sum of deal_amount; averages computed over non-NULL amounts. - avg_stage_cycle_time: average cycle time for Won deals only. - median_stage_cycle_time: continuous median (50th percentile) of non-NULL cycle times in the group. - Compute quarterly_performance_trends grouped by (created_year, created_quarter), including only rows with both present: - quarterly_deals_created: number of deals created in the cohort. - quarterly_deal_value_created: sum of deal_amount (NULL if all amounts are NULL). - same_quarter_wins: count of deals that were created and closed Won in the same year-quarter. - same_quarter_revenue: sum of deal_amount for those same-quarter Wins (0 when none in the cohort). - same_quarter_conversion_rate: percentage of cohort deals that closed Won in the same quarter (0–100); 0 when the cohort size is zero. - Left join stage metrics on (deal_pipeline, deal_pipeline_stage) and quarterly metrics on (created_year, created_quarter). - If a join has no match (e.g., stage ID or created_date is NULL), all joined metrics from that source are NULL. - Output one row per deal_id with base fields plus matched stage and quarterly metrics; percentages are 0–100 with no rounding; standard aggregates ignore NULL inputs.'\n",
